{
  "_comment": "Dark photon projection (Asimov) \u2014 Si mermin ELF, n_e observable space, 1 kg-yr, DC=1e-5 e/pix/day. Covers up to n_e=8 (Emax=35 eV, limited by p100K_table.csv max of 50 eV). No real data \u2014 sensitivity estimate only.",
